{"id":"600886","name":"包汤圆","author":"糖糖食味记","authorId":"12729364","desc":"","cover":"images/600886/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"红糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备适量红糖。","img":"images/600886/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成细末。","img":"images/600886/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再准备一些炒花生、熟黑芝麻。","img":"images/600886/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"花生樁成花生末。","img":"images/600886/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"黑芝麻樁碎。","img":"images/600886/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将准备好的花生、芝麻、红糖搅拌均匀。","img":"images/600886/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"准备适量糯米粉。","img":"images/600886/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"images/600886/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉成长条后，均匀分块。","img":"images/600886/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"之后捏成这种中心空心形状。","img":"images/600886/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将调好的馅料放入面团内。","img":"images/600886/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"封口后搓成圆团。","img":"images/600886/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"像这样就可以啦。","img":"images/600886/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"水开后将汤圆下入锅内，煮至漂浮水面，再煮两到三分钟。","img":"images/600886/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"出锅就可以吃啦～","img":"images/600886/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/600886/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"和面团的时候水慢慢加，不要一次加太多，不然容易面团太软包的时候无法成型。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}